  "author": "Lars Smith Eier <larssmitheier@protonmail.com>",
  "date": "2026-08-29T22:42:56Z",
  "subject": "cilium: enable kube-proxy-replacement (k3s runs --disable-kube-proxy)",
  "body": "k3s is installed with --flannel-backend=none --disable-kube-proxy, so\ncilium must act as the service proxy too. Without kubeProxyReplacement,\nNodePort/LoadBalancer services (envoy-gateway's 30080/30443) are never\nserved, which is why auth.skinke.net's HTTP-01 ACME challenge and the\ngateway nodeports hang.\n\nsocketLB.hostNamespaceOnly matches k3s (no socket-LB fallback to eth).\n"
}
